Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 07:40:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] fix(windows): harden package, installer, and update
 handling

Produce deterministic ConPTY package archives, keep installer staging paths short for Windows PowerShell 5.1, normalize vendor patch inventory paths, and let downstream preview builds select their own manifest and Windows installer while reusing Herdr update mechanics.
---
